 offers a unique opportunity in the city's thriving property market.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Ellison_Town_Square_Dubai_by_Nshama_e793a83963.jpg","hash":"Ellison_Town_Square_Dubai_by_Nshama_e793a83963","name":"Ellison Town Square Dubai by Nshama"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Ellison_Town_Square_Dubai_by_Nshama_9fbc2250b2.jpg","hash":"Ellison_Town_Square_Dubai_by_Nshama_9fbc2250b2","name":"Ellison Town Square Dubai by Nshama"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Ellison_Town_Square_Dubai_by_Nshama_863c2b9697.jpg","hash":"Ellison_Town_Square_Dubai_by_Nshama_863c2b9697","name":"Ellison Town Square Dubai by Nshama"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Ellison_Town_Square_Dubai_by_Nshama_91a4587410.jpg","hash":"Ellison_Town_Square_Dubai_by_Nshama_91a4587410","name":"Ellison Town Square Dubai by Nshama"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Ellison_Town_Square_Dubai_by_Nshama_2b3f2aa84e.jpg","hash":"Ellison_Town_Square_Dubai_by_Nshama_2b3f2aa84e","name":"Ellison Town Square Dubai by Nshama"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Ellison_Town_Square_Dubai_by_Nshama_9f538dfcda.jpg","hash":"Ellison_Town_Square_Dubai_by_Nshama_9f538dfcda","name":"Ellison Town Square Dubai by Nshama"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Ellison_Town_Square_Dubai_by_Nshama_0ed274fc78.jpg","hash":"Ellison_Town_Square_Dubai_by_Nshama_0ed274fc78","name":"Ellison Town Square Dubai by Nshama"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Ellison_Town_Square_Dubai_by_Nshama_b03fe0ad75.jpg","hash":"Ellison_Town_Square_Dubai_by_Nshama_b03fe0ad75","name":"Ellison Town Square Dubai by Nshama"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Ellison_Town_Square_Dubai_by_Nshama_f16b9c447c.jpg","has